uyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0028","question_id":"CQ-Q0028","citation_id":"smp-0c727157750947d0a2c9cbd5dbaaa9a5:8","title":"2026全新达人分销带货逻辑🔥。⭕底层核心定位，告别传统砸钱投流、高价坑位费、只靠头部主播的低效带货模式，KOC 达人全域分销是 2026 低成本、高复购、低风险的全新带货体系，商家、达人、消费者三方共赢，吃透这套逻辑能少走半年电商弯路。 . 五大核心价值观点 ✅（一）模式价值：重构带货底层，跳出流量内卷陷阱 . ✅（二）商家价值：解决中小商家带货 4 大痛点 . ✅（三）达人 / KOC 价值：","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662678918507896485","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7662678918507896485","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0028","question_id":"CQ-Q0028","citation_id":"smp-0c727157750947d0a2c9cbd5dbaaa9a5:9","title":"如何做好达人分销？用对三大类达人、用好六种分销模式#卡思咨询 #全域增长战略 #4S2B2C #达人分销 #商业咨询","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7605498615292775722","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7605498615292775722","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0028","question_id":"CQ-Q0028","citation_id":"smp-0c727157750947d0a2c9cbd5dbaaa9a5:10","title":"什么叫达人分销❓达人分销怎么做❓。⭕️达人分销：简单来说，达人分销就是品牌方找网红、博主（统称为“达人”）帮忙卖货，达人凭带货销量拿提成（佣金）的模式。这在抖音、小红书等平台非常主流。 . 📌达人分销","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7627435711834263973","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7627435711834263973","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]}]